# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that we omitted the controlled modular exponentiation operations from the remaining control qubits because $M_1$ is the identity operator.\n"
"Note that later in this tutorial, we will run this circuit on the `ibm_marrakesh` backend. To do this, we transpile the circuit according to this specific backend and report the circuit depth and gate counts.\n"
msgstr ""
